PIS 0.3.0 - 2026-11-07

* Added automatic backup and restoration of changed configuration files.
* Added a configuration/status screen and a system compatibility check.
* Added a shared implementation used by menus and profile application.
* Added versioned, validated profiles that never store passwords.
* Changed slackpkg profiles to store mirror URLs instead of line numbers.
* Added current-state information to configuration menus.
* Hid password input and stopped recording user passwords.
* Preserved supplementary groups when adding a user to wheel.
* Validated sudoers changes with visudo.
* Reworked ELILO publication and initrd generation, including NVMe roots.
* Stopped treating the root filesystem as a resume device.
* Removed incompatible OpenSSL library symlink creation.
* Updated package integrations for Slackware 15.0 and rejected current repos.
* Added download, package and post-installation result checks.
* Generated X keyboard menus from the installed XKB database.
* Added regression tests for core configuration operations.
